## client → service
GET /api-ws/v1/realtime?model=qwen3-asr-flash-realtime
Authorization: Bearer <key>
OpenAI-Beta: realtime=v1
→ text {"event_id":"<event-id>","session":{"input_audio_format":"pcm","modalities":["text"],"sample_rate":16000,"turn_detection":{"silence_duration_ms":800,"threshold":0.35,"type":"server_vad"}},"type":"session.update"}
→ text {"audio":"<base64 of 3200 bytes>","event_id":"<event-id>","type":"input_audio_buffer.append"}
→ text {"event_id":"<event-id>","type":"session.finish"}

